WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520
Wife, this is me, Brother Xiao

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,440
Brother Xiao, like me, comes from the countryside.

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:05,360
So there are some things that he finds strange when he sees them

4
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,880
We are eating out, let’s not talk about it for now.

5
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,960
Come on, Brother Xiao, let’s have another drink

6
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:11,200
During this time, I remember that I had more money to go back to.

7
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,040
My wife asked me not to be so tired

8
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:15,900
But she didn't know I was working with you before

9
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:17,420
you took care of me

10
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:19,100
Otherwise, how could I make so much money?

11
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,020
So when I told my wife yesterday

12
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:23,020
My wife said, I must treat you to dinner

13
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:25,260
I thought about it and thought she was right.

14
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:26,940
Is there anything else you want to eat?

15
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:28,940
Let's order some more. You have a big appetite.

16
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,060
I'm afraid you won't have enough to eat

17
00:00:30,140 --> 00:00:32,940
No need. Isn’t the food here free to eat?

18
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:40,540
As long as you have food, the dishes don’t need to be so plentiful to be delicious.

19
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:43,420
I have to say that people who are immortals are better at eating.

20
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:47,340
I really don’t know when I, the residents of Shazhou, will be able to eat such good food.

21
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:48,940
It's really hard to imagine

22
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:52,220
These things to eat are so unimportant in this world

23
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:54,060
What they think about is how to make it delicious

24
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,380
But what we think about is how to eat enough

25
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:58,540
The gap between them is not too big
